     1	"""Pins the frame-averaged training config against its vanilla twin.
     2	
     3	``FLAC_AR_FA.json`` is meant to be ``FLAC_AR.json`` plus the conditioning
     4	method, its orbit, and gradient checkpointing on the two ViT conditioners --
     5	nothing else. Any other drift between the two files silently turns an ablation
     6	into a confound, so the difference is asserted leaf-by-leaf here. The backbone's
     7	Hugging Face ``revision`` is pinned in both files and must stay identical, so the
     8	two arms start from the same immutable snapshot of the geometry encoder.
     9	"""
