   244	--val-dataset-config /path/to/eval/dataset/config \
   245	--cfg-scale 1.0 \
   246	--steps 1 \
   247	--name FLAC \
   248	--ckpt-path /path/to/FLAC/ckpt
   249	```
   250	
   251	**Reduced Acoustic Context**: To evaluate FLAC with a lower number of context RIRs, use the appropriate config files in `src/configs/dataset_configs`.
   252	
   253	### VAE 
   254	To eval the VAE:
   255	
   256	```bash
   257	python eval_VAE.py \
   258	--model-config /path/to/model/config \
   259	--dataset-config /path/to/eval/dataset/config \
   260	--eval-name eval_VAE \
   261	--ckpt-path /path/to/VAE/ckpt
   262	```
   263	**Note**: You need to give the `.ckpt` file in that case, not the `.safetensors` file.
   264	
   265	## AGREE
   266	
   267	### Evaluation
   268	Run
   269	```bash
   270	python -m AGREE_train.main \
   271	--data-path /path/to/AR/Dataset \
