     1	"""Tests for the ``--max-steps`` training-budget flag on ``train.py``.
     2	
     3	Motivation: ``train.py`` used to hard-code ``max_steps=1000000`` inside the
     4	``pl.Trainer(...)`` construction (with a ``#1000 for HAA`` comment), so running a shorter
