     6	
     7	* ``defaults.ini`` + prefigure plumbing — the ini key ``max_steps`` must surface as
     8	  ``args.max_steps`` (an int) and default to 1_000_000, preserving the previous behaviour.
     9	  The README's HAA finetune recipe now overrides it with ``--max-steps 1000`` instead of a
    10	  code edit, so the CLI flag must win over the ini default.
    11	* ``train.build_trainer_kwargs`` — a pure, side-effect-free extraction of the exact keyword
    12	  dict previously inlined into ``pl.Trainer``. It threads ``args.max_steps`` through to the
    13	  trainer while reproducing every other kwarg unchanged (precision, accumulate_grad_batches,
    14	  gradient_clip_val, devices/num_nodes/strategy/callbacks/logger/default_root_dir, the fixed
    15	  log_every_n_steps=100 / num_sanity_val_steps=0 / reload_dataloaders_every_n_epochs=0, and
    16	  the conditional val_args merge). This is the non-regression guard.
